Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:12:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/30] tests: tf-drama-codec-stream-oracle, whole against
 chunked codec decodes

Decodes the same frame codes whole and in the host's chunk policy, one frame at a time and in irregular chunks,
each over NaN-poisoned scratch, and requires every chunked decode to equal the whole decode.
